+            HTML5: The Canvas Element</a></cite>,
+            World Wide Web Consortium (W3C).
+        </dd>
+
+        <dt id="refsCANVASCONTEXTS">[CANVASCONTEXTS]</dt>
+        <dd><cite><a href="http://wiki.whatwg.org/wiki/CanvasContexts">
+            Canvas Context Registry</a></cite>,
+            WHATWG.
